        "stone": "diamond",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "stones": 14,
        "label": "A border of diamonds"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It copied the coronation ring of William the Fourth, only smaller.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "band",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "stone": "amethyst",
        "label": "A smaller copy"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "But the goldsmiths sized it for her little finger.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
